  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BluePeak is an impact-driven private capital fund investing in mid-market businesses operating in Africa across several sectors through privately negotiated subordinated &amp; mezzanine instruments. The fund reached a first close in 2021 and completed a second close in September 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
